{"id":"jigme-village","name":"Jigme Village","type":"location","aliases":["Jigme"],"description":"A village where the twins adjudicate a case of stolen apples.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2014-10-15","last_seen":"2014-10-15","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kela and Dar Chensal","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Kela and Dar Chensal\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e0","summary":"Kela and Dar walk toward Jigme Village to arbitrate a theft case while village children stare at their glowing dragon's eye marks.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","chensal-twins"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":5,"quote":"A handful of Jigme Village children were racing toward them along the far bank of the babbling river.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=A%20handful%20of%20Jigme,of%20the%20babbling%20river.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=A%20handful%20of%20Jigme,of%20the%20babbling%20river.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e1","summary":"A girl in a tree falls when her branch breaks but lands like a cat and shyly smiles at Kela.","participants":["the-girl-from-the-tree","kela-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":23,"quote":"She landed soundlessly in a crouch like a cat on the side of the path.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20landed%20soundlessly%20in,side%20of%20the%20path.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20landed%20soundlessly%20in,side%20of%20the%20path.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e2","summary":"Dar scolds Kela for smiling and speaking, insisting the twins' justice rests on how they are perceived.","participants":["dar-chensal","kela-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"You shall not show emotion. What we do, it's all about perception, Kela.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=You%20shall%20not%20show,all%20about%20perception%2C%20Kela.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=You%20shall%20not%20show,all%20about%20perception%2C%20Kela.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e4","summary":"The court hears the case against Lotse Taring, accused of stealing nine baskets of apples; Kela and Dar listen in deep meditation.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","lotse-taring","elder-ngabo"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":57,"quote":"Nine baskets of apples had been stolen from the Village reserve.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Nine%20baskets%20of%20apples,from%20the%20Village%20reserve.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Nine%20baskets%20of%20apples,from%20the%20Village%20reserve.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e6","summary":"Kela leaves her lamp unlit; Dar lights his, and the villagers declare Lotse guilty.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":84,"quote":"Lotse was guilty. Dar had lit his lamp.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Lotse%20was%20guilty.%20Dar%20had%20lit%20his%20lamp.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Lotse%20was%20guilty.%20Dar%20had%20lit%20his%20lamp.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e7","summary":"At the celebration, Elder Ngabo drinks apple soup and dies, apparently poisoned.","participants":["elder-ngabo"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":92,"quote":"She raised her hands to her neck, clawing wildly, her face turning gray.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20raised%20her%20hands,her%20face%20turning%20gray.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20raised%20her%20hands,her%20face%20turning%20gray.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e8","summary":"The villagers blame Lotse for poisoning the elder and storm the prison to kill him.","participants":["lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":102,"quote":"She was poisoned!\" This voice was loud and sure. \"It was the apples!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20was%20poisoned%21%22%20This,%22It%20was%20the%20apples%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20was%20poisoned%21%22%20This,%22It%20was%20the%20apples%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e9","summary":"Kela leaps between Lotse and a warrior's sword, demanding that he receive a trial.","participants":["kela-chensal","lotse-taring","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":117,"quote":"He should have a trial,\" she whispered.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=He%20should%20have%20a%20trial%2C%22%20she%20whispered.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=He%20should%20have%20a%20trial%2C%22%20she%20whispered.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e10","summary":"Kela invokes the Rules of the Reeds, and Dar reluctantly agrees to a quick judgment before the mob has Lotse's head.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":143,"quote":"But we will be quick.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=But%20we%20will%20be%20quick.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=But%20we%20will%20be%20quick.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e12","summary":"The mob storms the towers, and Kela escapes out the window on the air currents, pursued by Dar.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":161,"quote":"Kela sprang out through the window.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20sprang%20out%20through%20the%20window.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20sprang%20out%20through%20the%20window.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e13","summary":"Dar claims to know the judgment and knocks Kela from the air; she falls to the ground and refuses to concede.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":167,"quote":"She lost her footing and her control and she plummeted to the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20lost%20her%20footing,plummeted%20to%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20lost%20her%20footing,plummeted%20to%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e14","summary":"The twins fight the Combat of Clarity, and Kela, seeing everything clearly, defeats Dar.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","combat-of-clarity"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"Kela leapt into a spinning strike and landed in a crouch on the ground with her knee on Dar's chest and her blade at his throat.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20leapt%20into%20a,blade%20at%20his%20throat.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20leapt%20into%20a,blade%20at%20his%20throat.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e15","summary":"Kela spares Dar and offers him balance, and the twins stand before the villagers as equals.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":184,"quote":"For the first time, they stood together before the villagers as equals.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=For%20the%20first%20time%2C,the%20villagers%20as%20equals.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=For%20the%20first%20time%2C,the%20villagers%20as%20equals.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e16","summary":"Dar announces that Lotse will have a fair trial, and the girl from the tree rings the gong.","participants":["dar-chensal","the-girl-from-the-tree","kela-chensal","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":210,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":185,"quote":"The man will have a fair trial,\" Dar said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=The%20man%20will%20have,fair%20trial%2C%22%20Dar%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=The%20man%20will%20have,fair%20trial%2C%22%20Dar%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"kela-and-dar-chensal-e0","summary":"Kela and Dar are called to Jigme Village to judge the theft of nine baskets of apples; Elder Ngabo brings them before Lotse Taring.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","elder-ngabo","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/kela-and-dar-chensal","order":1120,"story_date":"","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Kela and Dar were called to Jigme Village to adjudicate a case of nine baskets of apples that had been stolen.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=Kela%20and%20Dar%20were,that%20had%20been%20stolen.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kela and Dar Chensal","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=Kela%20and%20Dar%20were,that%20had%20been%20stolen.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Kela and Dar Chensal\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"kela-and-dar-chensal-e1","summary":"Dar lights the lamp of guilt, ending the trial and convicting Lotse of theft.","participants":["dar-chensal","kela-chensal","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/kela-and-dar-chensal","order":1120,"story_date":"","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"revealing that Dar had lit the lamp of guilt, ending the trial.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=revealing%20that%20Dar%20had,guilt%2C%20ending%20the%20trial.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kela and Dar Chensal","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=revealing%20that%20Dar%20had,guilt%2C%20ending%20the%20trial.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Kela and Dar Chensal\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"kela-and-dar-chensal-e2","summary":"Elder Ngabo chokes and dies after tasting the apple soup, and villagers accuse Lotse of poisoning.","participants":["elder-ngabo","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"wiki/kela-and-dar-chensal","order":1120,"story_date":"","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":3,"quote":"She commented that the soup was delicious, then suddenly choked and died.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=She%20commented%20that%20the,suddenly%20choked%20and%20died.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kela and Dar Chensal","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal#:~:text=She%20commented%20that%20the,suddenly%20choked%20and%20died.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Kela and Dar Chensal\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"kela-and-dar-chensal-e3","summary":"Kela demands a fair trial for Lotse, and in the new trial both twins light their lamps, disagreeing.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"wiki/kela-and-dar-chensal","order":1120,"story_date":"","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":3,"quote":"but this time both Kela and Dar lit their lamps at the same time.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kela_and_Dar_Chensal